---
// About Teaser - Two-column section with image and bio preview
---

<section class="section-padding bg-midnight" id="about-teaser">
  <div class="container-custom mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 lg:gap-16 items-center">

      <!-- Image Column (Layered Presentation Photo) -->
      <div class="relative">
        <div class="rounded-3xl overflow-hidden shadow-2xl border border-ivory/15 bg-midnight-light relative group">
          <img
            src="/images/dr-sylvia-amee-speaker-podium.jpg"
            alt="Dr. Sylvia V. Shitsama delivering a research presentation at AMEE Vienna"
            class="w-full h-auto block object-cover group-hover:scale-105 transition-transform duration-700"
            width="800"
            height="900"
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-t from-midnight/90 via-midnight/20 to-transparent pointer-events-none"></div>
          
          <!-- Floating Credential Card -->
          <div class="absolute bottom-5 left-5 right-5 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-midnight/90 backdrop-blur-md border border-copper/30 shadow-xl">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1">
              <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-copper animate-pulse"></span>
              <span class="text-xs font-mono text-copper uppercase tracking-wider font-semibold">AMEE Vienna Keynote Presenter</span>
            </div>
            <p class="text-xs text-ivory/90 font-light">
              "Faculty Perspectives on Mentorship & Culture in Sub-Saharan Africa" — Maastricht University & UoN
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Decorative element -->
        <div class="absolute -bottom-4 -right-4 w-28 h-28 border-2 border-copper/30 rounded-3xl -z-10 hidden lg:block"></div>
        <div class="absolute -top-4 -left-4 w-20 h-20 bg-copper/10 rounded-3xl -z-10 hidden lg:block"></div>
      </div>

      <!-- Text Column -->
      <div>
        <span class="font-mono-label text-copper mb-4 block">About</span>
        <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-semibold text-ivory mb-8">
          A Surgeon, A Scientist, A Changemaker
        </h2>

        <div class="space-y-5 text-sage leading-relaxed">
          <p>
            Born in Kakamega County in 1983, Dr. Sylvia V. Shitsama grew up with a singular vision: to heal. 
            That vision carried her through the University of Nairobi — first for her Bachelor of Medicine and Surgery, 
            then for her Master of Medicine in Neurosurgery — making her <strong class="text-ivory">Kenya's first qualified female neurosurgeon</strong>.
          </p>

          <p>
            In 2019, she completed a Clinical and Research Fellowship in General Neurosurgery at the 
            <strong class="text-ivory">University of Toronto, Canada</strong>, bringing world-class training 
            and research methodology back to East Africa. Today, she serves as a Consultant Neurosurgeon at 
            Kenyatta National Referral Hospital and Senior Lecturer at JKUAT.
          </p>

          <p>
            But Dr. Shitsama is more than her credentials. She is a mentor to aspiring surgeons, 
            a voice for women in medicine, and a tireless advocate for expanding neurosurgical access 
            across the continent. Recognised twice among Kenya's 
            <strong class="text-ivory">Top 40 Under 40 Women</strong>, 
            she doesn't just operate on brains — she opens minds.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8">
          <a href="/about" class="btn-primary">
            Read Full Story
            <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" aria-hidden="true">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"/>
            </svg>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
